===Pronunciation===
* {{a|Brazil}} {{IPA|/poʁ.ˈke/|/puʁ.ˈke/|lang=pt}}
** {{a|Caipira|South Brazil}} {{IPA|/puɹ.ˈke/|lang=pt}}
* {{a|Portugal}} {{IPA|/ˈpuɾ.kɨ/|lang=pt}}
* {{hyphenation|por|que|lang=pt}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|roa-opt|pt}} {{m|roa-opt|porque}}, corresponding to {{compound|por|que|t1=for|t2=that|lang=pt}}.

Cognate with Galician {{m|gl|porque}}, Spanish {{m|es|porque}}, Catalan {{m|ca|perquè}}, French {{m|fr|parce que}} and Italian {{m|it|perché}}.

===Conjunction===
{{head|pt|conjunction}}

# {{l|en|because}}; {{l|en|for}} {{gloss|''introduces an explanation to the claim in the previous clause''}}
#: {{ux|pt|Aproveita tua vida '''porque''' ela é curta!|Enjoy your life '''because''' it is short!}}

